      "evidenceNeeded": "Training records showing what diagnostic steps are required when 'supply complaints' appear at RHOB controls, and examples of past incidents where similar observations led to correct root cause identification.","question":"What specific diagnostic actions should an operator take upon seeing a supply complaint indication without being able to identify the interruption point?"
